<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>RAG on ByF (BaiFan) · 每日深度思考</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/tags/rag/</link><description>Recent content in RAG on ByF (BaiFan) · 每日深度思考</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</managingEditor><webMaster>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</webMaster><copyright>CC BY-NC 4.0</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:25:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.baifan.site/tags/rag/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>分类器又成了救世主</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/the-classifier-returns/</link><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 13:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/the-classifier-returns/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在任何一家号称“全面接入 AI”的企业技术团队里，最不能细看的账单通常不是生产环境的推理开销，而是那一堆为了自欺欺人而跑出来的&lt;strong&gt;评估流水线（Eval Pipelines）&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>深度解读 TencentDB Agent Memory：让 AI Agent 真正拥有分层记忆</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/tencentdb-agent-memory-deep-dive/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 Feb 2026 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/tencentdb-agent-memory-deep-dive/</guid><description>&lt;!-- more --&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;为什么 AI Agent 需要记忆系统？&#10; &lt;div id="为什么-ai-agent-需要记忆系统" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e4%b8%ba%e4%bb%80%e4%b9%88-ai-agent-%e9%9c%80%e8%a6%81%e8%ae%b0%e5%bf%86%e7%b3%bb%e7%bb%9f" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;如果你有过长时间使用 AI Agent 的经验，一定对以下场景不陌生：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>基于 Ollama 与 pgvector 的本地 RAG 系统搭建与检索实践</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/rag-system-complete-guide-langchain-ollama-pgvector/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 Aug 2025 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/rag-system-complete-guide-langchain-ollama-pgvector/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;基于 Ollama、LangChain 与 PostgreSQL pgvector 构建本地检索增强生成（RAG）系统，能够在完全离线与私有化环境下实现文档切分、向量化存储与上下文生成。示例代码仓库位于 &lt;a href="https://github.com/ByronFinn/rag-lab.git" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;rag-lab&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Prompt 与上下文工程：结构化约束与状态控制</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/prompt-engineering-context-management-complete-guide/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 Aug 2025 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/prompt-engineering-context-management-complete-guide/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;AI 教程：Prompt Engineering&#10; &lt;div id="ai-教程prompt-engineering" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#ai-%e6%95%99%e7%a8%8bprompt-engineering" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;提示工程主要关注提示词的设计、优化与策略制定，致力于帮助用户更高效地调动大语言模型的能力，进而推动其在各类实际场景和研究领域中的应用。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>